cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  ExoNotes: do ExoFOP observer notes carry disposition signal beyond the numeric
  TOI catalogue?
message: >-
  If you use this work, please cite it. Please also cite the sources it depends on: the
  Exoplanet Follow-up Observation Program (ExoFOP) and the NASA Exoplanet Archive, both
  operated by the California Institute of Technology under contract with NASA under the
  Exoplanet Exploration Program.
